        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1318  Decorative Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis domed style upright floor stop is very easy to install. Packaged with a mounting anchor and rubber bumper ring.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFuturistic design, plus great protection for your door hardware and walls. Only 1 hole to drill for fast easy installation. The rubber bumper ring goes all the way around the door stop, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 1318 Decorative Floor Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base to Bumper Center Height: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: Black</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
